Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.91,0:00:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.89,0:00:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.53,0:00:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.37,0:00:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.87,0:01:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What's in there, Yook?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the biggest Chinese\Nrestaurant I've ever seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.41,0:01:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And get a load of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.27,0:01:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just in time for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.23,0:01:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And talk about all you can eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.71,0:01:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a challenge to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.51,0:01:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy, cowboys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.41,0:01:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't see you two on the guest list.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.91,0:01:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Vivian.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.37,0:01:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,She let us here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.53,0:01:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.91,0:01:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Because she's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.99,0:01:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,As if you couldn't tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.49,0:01:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come down here and tell\Nus what's going on. Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.69,0:02:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! She's falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.17,0:02:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Really slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.29,0:02:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.73,0:02:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Vivian's got a little helper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.23,0:02:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.87,0:02:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This is getting weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.39,0:02:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what are you doing in here, Gramps?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.93,0:02:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I can explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.03,0:02:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You Nimrod!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.37,0:02:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You had one simple job!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.05,0:02:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.53,0:02:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get it next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.03,0:02:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He works fine. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.99,0:02:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Vivian kidnap you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.75,0:02:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Or did you guys plan this\Nwhole thing together?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.07,0:02:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, forget about that, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.85,0:02:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's talk about you and me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.19,0:03:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the real Grand\NChampionship Tournament, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.93,0:03:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Where you and I are gonna\Nduke it out for the crown!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.11,0:03:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.47,0:03:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You had your chance and Rebecca\Ncancelled you out, Viv! That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.03,0:03:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the winner of the\Ntournament gets a title shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.49,0:03:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You already blew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.41,0:03:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.81,0:03:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starting my own tournament, and\Nthe first match is Yugi against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.85,0:03:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.31,0:03:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty please?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.13,0:03:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Viv.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.21,0:03:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's against Kaiba's\Ntournament rules. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.49,0:03:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.51,0:03:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The right thing to do\Nis duel against Vivian.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.21,0:03:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.41,0:03:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that demented diva must\Nhave hypnotized you, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.29,0:03:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.25,0:03:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You kids have got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.49,0:03:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite an amusing story, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.75,0:03:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I was relaxing in my hospital\Nbed when Vivian came by.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.87,0:04:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My back was slightly irritated. Mr. Moto?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.69,0:04:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I may be able to help you out\Nif you help me. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.65,0:04:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything. Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.97,0:04:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.13,0:04:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My pack is cured. Thank you, Had.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.03,0:04:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,it not been for vivian i wouldn't be
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.05,0:04:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,standing here so i owed her a favor\Nthat's why i led you kids here and turned
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.27,0:04:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,his back on his own grandson hey i\Nheard that and to think i once looked
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.47,0:04:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,up to you you forgot what's important\Nyou forgot the heart of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.79,0:04:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.21,0:04:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What have I done?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.55,0:04:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.75,0:04:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's how it's going to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.43,0:04:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Have it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.03,0:04:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.94,0:04:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.85,0:04:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to Yugi's grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.49,0:04:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I just returned him to the way he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.53,0:05:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.44,0:05:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.37,0:05:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.47,0:05:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want your Gramps\Nto walk upright again,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.01,0:05:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,you're gonna have to duel me that's a\Ndirty trick i know and i can't believe
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.93,0:05:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,i didn't think of it sooner so who's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.91,0:05:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,it gonna be yugi your grandfather or
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.63,0:05:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,me don't listen to a yug we can save\Nyour grandpa without her help but how
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.27,0:05:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,he needs us what should we do we have\Nno choice we have to duel All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.03,0:05:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.17,0:05:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to set things straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.21,0:05:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.67,0:05:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought, I knew\Nyou couldn't resist my charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.69,0:05:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, if you defeat\Nme, then your grandpa walks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.21,0:05:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you lose, we go on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.53,0:05:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.89,0:06:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard just about\Nenough out of you, toots.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.37,0:06:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it through your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi doesn't like you and he never will!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.19,0:06:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, just breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.19,0:06:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's your challenge,\Nthen I must accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.49,0:06:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.89,0:06:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.15,0:06:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi can duel circles around her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.17,0:06:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't count on it, losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.29,0:06:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm about to unleash the\Ndevastating force of Hurricane Vivian!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.39,0:06:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.15,0:06:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Our last semi-final match is a close\Nlook, folks, as Rebecca faces Leon Wilson!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.99,0:06:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, kids. My move!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.89,0:06:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate my Pot of Greed Magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.57,0:06:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can draw two more\Ncards from my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.59,0:06:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll play this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.91,0:06:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My Witch of the Black Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.83,0:06:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to turn your\Ncarriage into pumpkin pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.35,0:07:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Cinderella's not\Ngoing to the ball after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.31,0:07:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor little princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.35,0:07:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Not exactly. Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.49,0:07:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Cinderella, attack her witch of\Nthe Black Forest with Shatterkick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.33,0:07:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And her shoes come back without a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.41,0:07:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But at least my witch\Nwasn't blown up for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.93,0:07:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,When she goes to the graveyard,\Nher special ability activates,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.03,0:07:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,letting me transfer my\NRuby Dragon to my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.21,0:07:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.51,0:07:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I summon Tom Thumb in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.27,0:07:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll place this face\Ndown to end my turn. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.13,0:07:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How will I ever fight against\Na fairy princess and an elf?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.33,0:07:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.49,0:07:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.17,0:07:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruby Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.05,0:07:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.01,0:07:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I attack, I'm going to\Nactivate my Dragonspire magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.59,0:08:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It gives my dragon a bonus power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.69,0:08:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The ability to wipe out any monster\Nthat has 800 defense points or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.01,0:08:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast his little garden\Ngnome with crimson commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.55,0:08:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.13,0:08:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.55,0:08:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Go negate attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.97,0:08:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And just like its name says,\Nmy card negates your attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.21,0:08:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.17,0:08:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're not, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.91,0:08:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He counteracts my moves every turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.87,0:08:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And without Yugi to cheer me on, I don't\Nhave the confidence I need to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.93,0:08:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.59,0:08:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best, Hawkins!\NHawkins! Hawkins!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.67,0:08:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,On second thought, I'm not alone at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.15,0:08:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got tons of support out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.59,0:08:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.41,0:08:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's run, Earl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.51,0:09:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be paying attention if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.49,0:09:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Giant's Training.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.39,0:09:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This card will be your downfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.69,0:09:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It lets me sacrifice Tom\NThumb in order to summon this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.13,0:09:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My good buddy Globerman in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.65,0:09:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now show her Ruby Dragon who's boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.15,0:09:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.81,0:09:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate trap card!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.55,0:09:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Rope of life!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.85,0:09:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It kicks in as soon as one of my\Nmonsters is sent to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.71,0:09:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I toss out my entire hand,\Nit lets me bring that monster back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.05,0:09:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and did I mention it gets\Nan extra 800 attack points?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.91,0:09:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So thanks for the power boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.15,0:09:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Next I'll activate a magic card!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.75,0:09:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Adamantine Sword Revival!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.49,0:10:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And it lets me replace the dragon I just\Nbrought back with an even stronger one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.43,0:10:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My Diamond Head Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.99,0:10:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It may start out with the same number of\Nattack points that my Ruby Dragon has,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.65,0:10:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But then it gets an extra\Nthousand thanks to my magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.67,0:10:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,3,400 attack points? Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.55,0:10:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.35,0:10:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait till you see what\NI've got planned next.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.83,0:10:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.37,0:10:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm never leaving this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.89,0:10:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you be eating now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.33,0:10:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi needs us out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.93,0:10:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't need us\Nyelling in his ear to win
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.25,0:10:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now relax, and try the chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.87,0:10:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind? Sesame!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.39,0:11:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, things aren't\Nlooking so good for Yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.11,0:11:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I sacrifice my Master\NKianchi and my Kung Fu Nian Nian.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.05,0:11:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This allows me to summon my Dragon\NLady in attack mode Not bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.89,0:11:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And next, I have a little something\Nspecial planned just for you. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.17,0:11:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I play Lightning Saber!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.11,0:11:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Which increases Dragon\NLady's strength by 300!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.85,0:11:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, attack his Dark Magician\Nwith Lightning Saber Swipe!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.77,0:11:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, direct attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.81,0:11:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How did she attack twice?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.77,0:11:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume that you figured this out by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.27,0:11:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But thanks to her new sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,all I have to do is cut my dragon lady's\Nstrength in half and she can attack twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.93,0:11:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.25,0:12:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I play Big Shield\NGardener in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.43,0:12:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll place one card\Nface down and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.99,0:12:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Yugi loses, at\Nleast he gets a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.65,0:12:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi won't lose, so drop the date thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.99,0:12:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for another double attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.33,0:12:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So first, I'll rid the field of\Nthat unsightly big shield gardener.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.11,0:12:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal my trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.19,0:12:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirror Force, block her attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.71,0:12:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll play this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.01,0:12:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a handy little number I\Nlike to call my Snowfall Sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.03,0:12:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And it cancels out the\Neffect of your Mirror Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.67,0:12:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.77,0:12:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's got no monsters on the\Nfield to protect his life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.05,0:12:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This seems like a good time to\Nactivate my flying dragon world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.35,0:13:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now all I have to do is send four\Nof my dragons to the card graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.83,0:13:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That raises my dragon lady's\Nattack points by 1,200.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.89,0:13:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.09,0:13:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.19,0:13:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, dragon lady, attack him directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.77,0:13:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it. I won. I won.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.45,0:13:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.97,0:13:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.05,0:13:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do now is discard my Karibo,\Nand my life points remain untouched.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.47,0:13:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you ruin my victory with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.65,0:13:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait until next turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.07,0:13:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.61,0:13:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no next turn. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.51,0:13:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to find out, because\NI'm ending this right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.93,0:13:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's impossible. We'll see. I draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.05,0:13:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.21,0:14:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll summon my skilled Dark\NMagician to the field in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.33,0:14:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Second, I activate Pot of Greed, which\Nlets me draw two more cards from my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.73,0:14:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll play this, the\NEmblem of Dragon Destroyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.99,0:14:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It lets me bring Buster\NBlader back to my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.61,0:14:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What are those lights?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.55,0:14:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They're spell counters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.25,0:14:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,With every magic card I\Nplay, another one lights up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.53,0:14:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.83,0:14:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My final magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.73,0:14:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's known as Monster Reincarnation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.87,0:14:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So Dark Magician's back in my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.21,0:14:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And now all three of my\Nspell counters are glowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.09,0:14:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can sacrifice my skill\NDark Magician In order
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.71,0:14:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,To summon Dark Magician. There's\Nmore. I play Polymerization.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.49,0:15:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Fusing my Dark Magician\Nwith my Buster Blader.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.73,0:15:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, the creature of your\Ndemise. My Dark Paladin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.63,0:15:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's one more\Nthing you should know Dark
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.17,0:15:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Paladin gets 500 attack\Npoints for every dragon on the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.63,0:15:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,field And in our graveyard\NThat can't be I just sent
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.95,0:15:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Four dragons to my card\Ngraveyard. It's not fair. Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.41,0:15:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,it's quite fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.37,0:15:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Dark Paladin, wipe out her\NDragon Lady and her Life Points!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.95,0:15:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Game over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.97,0:15:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.55,0:15:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Luke!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.45,0:16:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Viv, it's time\Nfor you to pay up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.43,0:16:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandpa's waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.43,0:16:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.99,0:16:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,With only 100 life points left,\Nyou better make this one count.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.79,0:16:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.27,0:16:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You showed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.61,0:16:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course we did. Hey, Beck. You\Ngo, girl. Yeah. Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.21,0:16:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.51,0:16:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No sleeping on the job, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.81,0:16:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Not with only 100 points left. No biggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.05,0:16:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lose now that my\Nlucky charm's finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.99,0:16:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.81,0:16:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.13,0:16:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start by attacking your\NGloberman with my Diamond Head Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.41,0:16:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.43,0:16:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do this, Beck! Stay strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.77,0:16:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card face\Ndown and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.91,0:16:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my new card,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.81,0:17:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,when Leon summons a monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.53,0:17:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,the difference between\Nits defense points and my
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.95,0:17:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,monster's attack points\Ncomes out of his life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So, as long as he plays something\Nwith less than 2,500 defense points,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.83,0:17:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I automatically win the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.19,0:17:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's see what you've got, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.95,0:17:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here goes my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.43,0:17:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start by activating my\NGold Moon Coin Magic Card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.63,0:17:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So that means the first thing I have to do
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.11,0:17:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,is hand over every card\NI'm holding to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.73,0:17:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I get to replace\Nthe cards I just gave up
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.49,0:17:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,by drawing the same number\Nof cards from my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.21,0:17:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Spinning Wheel Spindle?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.99,0:17:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.11,0:17:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You could have destroyed\Nmy monster with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.89,0:17:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.07,0:17:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But it wouldn't have wiped out your life\Npoint, so it was still too risky a move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.23,0:17:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.37,0:17:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,One that lets me win the\Nduel right away. Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.17,0:17:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.47,0:17:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but something tells\Nme Leon isn't bluffing, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.43,0:18:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, on to phase two.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.63,0:18:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate this, my 100-Year\NAwakening Magic card. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.53,0:18:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It lets me sacrifice my\NCurse of Thorns card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.59,0:18:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.39,0:18:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can summon Thorn Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.47,0:18:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point of all this, Leon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.91,0:18:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate her special ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.03,0:18:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Letting me control one of your\Nmonsters as if it were my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.03,0:18:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.37,0:18:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid so!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.93,0:18:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your Diamond Head Dragon is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.17,0:18:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now attack her life points directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.45,0:18:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We've completed our investigation of Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.43,0:18:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Siegfried Lloyd, and your\Nassumptions were correct, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.41,0:19:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Siegfried, your little game's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.01,0:19:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.47,0:19:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.73,0:19:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You played a great duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.07,0:19:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need your pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.51,0:19:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.25,0:19:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now don't let it go to your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.03,0:19:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a long way to go. That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.71,0:19:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Good game.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.99,0:19:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that wasn't half\Nbad for a couple of kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.89,0:19:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Kids that can out-duel you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.39,0:19:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, you did great. Thanks, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.61,0:19:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to win so badly, it's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.05,0:19:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.03,0:19:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get one?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.09,0:19:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Must she be so dramatic?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.09,0:19:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck! Who's talking? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.39,0:19:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.57,0:19:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this sound familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.21,0:19:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My back hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.49,0:19:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.61,0:19:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you do it in 50 years.
